            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="col-cname">Georgia</td>
              <td>1733 · Savannah (James Oglethorpe)</td>
              <td style="font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;">Georgia Charter (1732, proprietary to Oglethorpe and trustees)</td>
